# EmailJS credentials — used by the contact form.
# Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com (free), then:
#   1. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) and copy its Service ID
#   2. Create a Template using the variables { from_name, reply_to, message }
#      from src/components/Contact.jsx, and copy the Template ID
#   3. Account → General → copy the Public Key
#
# Copy this file to .env (or .env.local) and fill in the values:
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
